er it is in best condition even if compared to the delivery time when I bought the vehicle from Shree Honda in January 7th 2021. You'll find bills attached at the very end of this video. The interior and exterior was also cleaned before delivery.\n\nGoogle Map: https://maps.app.goo.gl/2tzdiPWKNrhgFxN9A\n\nPinnacle Honda পিনাকেল হোণ্ডা\n\nAddress Pinnacle Honda: No 739, Chandrani Towers Anandapur, near Ruby Hospital, Kolkata, West Bengal 700107\n\nContact Pinnacle Honda: 8657589016\n\nWebsite: https://dealer.hondacarindia.com/pinnacle-honda-chandrani-enterprises-pvt-ltd-car-dealer-anandapur-kolkata-67298/Home?utm_source=locator&utm_medium=googleplaces&utm_campaign=DD054\n\nIn this detailed long-form video, I take my Honda Amaze S MT 2021 for a body claim at Pinnacle Honda in Kolkata. I'll share my complete experience, from submitting the car for the claim to getting it back, along with all the unexpected service work that was done.\n\nMy car had a dent and a scratch, which was covered under a 1st party ICICI Lombard insurance policy purchased from Shree Honda. The best part? The entire body repair cost me only a ₹1,000 processing fee!\n\nBut that's not all. I also had some other issues resolved, all under warranty, including:\n\nA hard-to-move AC air circulation knob.\n\nA problematic glove box.\n\nA noisy clutch pedal.\n\nI'll share the bills at the end of the video as proof. This is a must-watch for anyone considering a Honda Amaze insurance claim or looking for a reliable service experience at a dealership in Kolkata. The car is now smoother than ever, even better than when I first got it!\n\nPinnacle Honda (পিনাকেল হোণ্ডা):\n\nAddress: No 739, Chandrani Towers Anandapur, near Ruby Hospital, Kolkata, West Bengal 700107\n\nContact: 8657589016\n\nWebsite: https://dealer.hondacarindia.com/pinnacle-honda-chandrani-enterprises-pvt-ltd-car-dealer-anandapur-kolkata-67298/Home?utm_source=locator&utm_medium=googleplaces&utm_campaign=DD054\n\n#HondaAmaze #CarInsuranceClaim 